  "_note": "Catalog cross-checked against ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Annex A (control titles per ISO/IEC 27002:2022): 93 controls across four themes \u2014 Organizational (A.5, 37), People (A.6, 8), Physical (A.7, 14), Technological (A.8, 34). The 2022 edition numbers controls sequentially within each theme (A.5.1-A.5.37, A.6.1-A.6.8, A.7.1-A.7.14, A.8.1-A.8.34) \u2014 no gaps, no sub-letters \u2014 unlike the gapped 2013 numbering (114 controls, A.5-A.18). Each control carries its theme; the emitter projects only the id into core.allowed-values. Paperwork existence/metadata/freshness only; ctxgrd never attests that a control is technically in force \u2014 implementation adequacy is the auditor's judgment (ADR-070 Context).",
